{"title":"Firefly’s All Road Rim Brake Clears a 700 x 40 mm Tire","link":"https://theradavist.com/fireflys-all-road-rim-brake-clears-a-700-x-40-mm-tire","date":1790352229000,"content":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/b47c0f97842d3cda6f82f74625d5a23d292780e375117c410c3ac4872c209cf2.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/58107ca6dea76f4786db468b364af6b614100cfa784e430362210462fb1a568c.jpg 640w, /media/b47c0f97842d3cda6f82f74625d5a23d292780e375117c410c3ac4872c209cf2.jpg 1800w, /media/819e4c67df5d98c59f4682660c7f966049414f2ab4d8053acf9b8e3603eb01a9.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><em>Looking forward while simultaneously working backward, <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/tag/firefly\" target=\"_blank\">Firefly</a> just unveiled a juicy All Road model that clears a 700 x 40 mm tire with <a href=\"https://www.canecreek.com/products/eebrakes\" target=\"_blank\">modified Cane Creek eeBrake</a> road calipers…</em><span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/fce4d70e78e1bb096b3318fe98665576e56c7ce22b387c22f9a01e44fedd6d01.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/a569299c5df412c14c49e6a49b4c35aeaeef69e8bf7bc136194c22a9659f5f6e.jpg 800w, /media/fce4d70e78e1bb096b3318fe98665576e56c7ce22b387c22f9a01e44fedd6d01.jpg 1600w, /media/93ecfb3a25e5b54acbcb422ab2979b6bd402314a7072b32e1c5b146023cadfee.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/815e053d25a6b9a32d75038db5636586c1f03912ac63b48982abf4c52aa82b6a.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/7c1b409e9815d43f95f519ec76225570b23d3936e1f8e2f73363f70bf09564c5.jpg 800w, /media/815e053d25a6b9a32d75038db5636586c1f03912ac63b48982abf4c52aa82b6a.jpg 1600w, /media/23a18c0285647b51f9aaa1985bd081e1aae5bc3ef33fc7c120afce7dc3dc6477.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/564615d8c9e95138fea14ce3ef7d220c054e5f6874f1197a5d238b9ea3d7fa52.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/aea0cc392acec0e7b2f4d6de8da2e1ae16896c312124e2188b0c98b8ae40fd71.jpg 800w, /media/564615d8c9e95138fea14ce3ef7d220c054e5f6874f1197a5d238b9ea3d7fa52.jpg 1600w, /media/2923ea8ffb90f9efd02df1b80a8921f05d8725b5ead584c07e0449ab05bb5754.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>Sometimes framebuilders’ innovations or designs are driven by customer needs. Other times, it’s to match modern components or tech demands. Builders these days are flooded with requests for more tire clearance, more chainring clearance, and faster geometries, which is what led Firefly to develop its <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/a-rad-rod-retrofit-my-firefly-2-0-chubby-road\" target=\"_blank\">3D-printed chainstay yokes</a> and seat tube knuckles, for example.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/b869728d168405f6ee8c2242c93d42d4de82c613f66f465a95017eddd80cf777.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/232b421de7263aa705bc1580aaba5c696e18c9c3012c3ed6ad9f2cf4bbe71273.jpg 800w, /media/ae8b7ada7ea1265857608eb5df366fbbfb182adc77b749dbea840998cb26dc27.jpg 1600w, /media/b869728d168405f6ee8c2242c93d42d4de82c613f66f465a95017eddd80cf777.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/45d76853569b6ba524286d7fd979717a30818b994ee22e0cc1b6818435b5831b.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/5c91cb711ca4ce0e9c513753c7824ab1fd672e5ba9f78bee708823caed686158.jpg 800w, /media/03f5da6edafe4e097994de4b0b4c37e9d76e54bae4dea6abb164adbf2ecf5890.jpg 1600w, /media/45d76853569b6ba524286d7fd979717a30818b994ee22e0cc1b6818435b5831b.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>No one was asking Firefly for a new rim brake model in 2026. But the Melrose, Massachusetts-based builders still believe in the value of the simplicity of rim brakes. The brand, renowned for exquisitely practical titanium models, realized it had all of the tools it needed to build a modern, versatile, beautiful new all-Ti rim brake bike, and duh, they couldn’t resist. All that it required was closing a few design gaps.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/08d8d1bfd3ad19c7205fab6a52c77f3b98b19b678cd2e2cd75384d03abb3dcff.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/1af9f1d41b78b0736735f38974064a27b2b5b5bdc9c2d69ffb6bed4bee6f967b.jpg 800w, /media/08d8d1bfd3ad19c7205fab6a52c77f3b98b19b678cd2e2cd75384d03abb3dcff.jpg 1600w, /media/868561ad1c439fa33083b374cb646f9b29e40ba3233fa4eb273c558715ea2a28.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/4b39d2185c33cd671c54e2716b55178f5185089a435f952a0a04167025046fdc.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/59f433838ae7cdc121aef2e5b56adac1071561b3f1c93d7439c7f8d8840958a2.jpg 800w, /media/4b39d2185c33cd671c54e2716b55178f5185089a435f952a0a04167025046fdc.jpg 1600w, /media/99fdd7c76e13a46824927bf5b471e9d53fe98990b120b427de887ff0101e6fe7.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/e839f7b2767f858bae8b37300903bc636c0779dbfc9f72e958d0679ec973deac.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/29d3f3953a828a29d8dc466c5d78b7ef7d0191ccc3511e4f8040e5505288d20e.jpg 800w, /media/e839f7b2767f858bae8b37300903bc636c0779dbfc9f72e958d0679ec973deac.jpg 1600w, /media/6fdcab6373acd7c6ea41f3bf2b7d5be59e46c28e592530ce3b58edebda144483.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>The benefits of bigger tires on road and all-road bikes are undeniable, so Firefly developed a new Ti All Road fork for medium-reach caliper brakes and 40 mm tire clearance.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/4f17671421d981b2d5103d07e8e31b7c1013d705aa0ad804f4cd6e4c789920b5.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/1e02ef505aa4c8e301ea0c75657a741d0a8600b7ffc4723a2b33622b74f87fc9.jpg 640w, /media/4f17671421d981b2d5103d07e8e31b7c1013d705aa0ad804f4cd6e4c789920b5.jpg 1800w, /media/fa1edc5b5f0bc9682981cddeeceabe01bf3b2a53e6cae6bda4c0d684ac756674.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>Firefly worked with Cane Creek to modify their spectacular Brompton eeBrakes with a traditional cable pull, giving the makers a top-of-the-line caliper brake with All Road tire clearance.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/15dd42f43453871b0328cde995621cc077f9307dc7ad59f74a8aeb438df76c8d.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/6b29a33542fb4d0b2d83df8717b6e2dfb889213c5aec669c62905975bc184670.jpg 800w, /media/3d80ad8c0ed75fc02d27269f0504e71a20ec1b31e00952d56fc2a4825ec70635.jpg 1600w, /media/15dd42f43453871b0328cde995621cc077f9307dc7ad59f74a8aeb438df76c8d.jpg\" /><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/bf28f9af86dbe26d9bcc922ebaa77fdbc3126742dcafb30c2d767367f8cda377.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/45f855952dcda8f23d197dec0fb04b7337ea18670f9c1b149e629ec12295fdf4.jpg 800w, /media/8accf90947e900f5662b3b872055ab18da363490ee2b2f4c22d00d787cf901e1.jpg 1600w, /media/bf28f9af86dbe26d9bcc922ebaa77fdbc3126742dcafb30c2d767367f8cda377.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>Good quick releases are hard to find now, and don’t work well with the Ti fork design to begin with, so Firefly created a new 3D-printed through-bolt dropout design that is lighter and stiffer than older plate dropouts, secures the wheels better than quick releases, and looks beautiful.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/d7104d400107df053c2e37bada84cd53de58982a05fac189fd2ebf278bbf12ae.jpg\" srcset=\"/media/12a685ebf91aa80b856ecaeedb327833f935fb6529b1d607dfad19f1c5c4eaef.jpg 640w, /media/d7104d400107df053c2e37bada84cd53de58982a05fac189fd2ebf278bbf12ae.jpg 1800w, /media/bf7b678a2e2073826cd24549a9f85384e32763ecc21e73ca3744bed7cb20c567.jpg\" /></p>\n<p>The result is a versatile, light, elegant, and modern All Road bike with the simplicity of caliper rim brakes.</p>\n<p>It’s not for everyone, naturally, but that’s the beauty of custom bikes; they can speak to niche audiences.</p>\n<p>See this stunning bike in more detail at <a href=\"https://fireflybicycles.com/all-road-rim-brake/\" target=\"_blank\">Firefly</a> and see it in person at this weekend’s <a href=\"https://www.craftedbikeshow.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Crafted Bike Show</a>.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theradavist.com/fireflys-all-road-rim-brake-clears-a-700-x-40-mm-tire\">Firefly’s All Road Rim Brake Clears a 700 x 40 mm Tire</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://cms.theradavist.com/\">The Radavist</a>.</p>","author":"John Watson","comments":"https://theradavist.com/fireflys-all-road-rim-brake-clears-a-700-x-40-mm-tire#comments","siteTitle":"The Radavist","siteHash":"96eb481d8084f04a4602bac57874ba717baf56b758f45547b5caf2312da766ef","entryHash":"ad73d53782d22e1f79e96cd5c1566c92eb7037e983885da562ca212597498ea5","category":"Cycling"}